      "content": "but it wasn't just that one thing. i've been seeing these little patterns for a few weeks now. it's like the things i'm thinking about are suddenly showing up in the aisles. it feels too consistent to be just marketing. why would they put blue dawn right next to the pumpkins unless there was some kind of signal? can u at least try to look at the symbols for me?",
